{"pairs":[{"pair":"horizontal-1","A":"screen-right","B":"screen-left","reason":"A 的眼线与鼻尖偏向画面右侧，B 对应偏向左侧。"},{"pair":"horizontal-2","A":"screen-right","B":"screen-left","reason":"A 面部轮廓朝右，B 面部轮廓朝左。"},{"pair":"horizontal-3","A":"screen-right","B":"screen-left","reason":"A 的鼻尖和视线明显指向右侧，B 明显指向左侧。"},{"pair":"horizontal-4","A":"screen-left","B":"screen-right","reason":"A 的侧脸鼻尖朝左，B 的侧脸鼻尖朝右。"},{"pair":"horizontal-5","A":"screen-right","B":"screen-left","reason":"A 侧脸与目光偏右，B 侧脸与目光偏左。"},{"pair":"horizontal-6","A":"screen-right","B":"screen-left","reason":"虽有低头，A 的鼻尖仍偏右，B 的鼻尖偏左。"},{"pair":"horizontal-7","A":"screen-right","B":"screen-left","reason":"低头轮廓中 A 的面部朝右，B 的面部朝左。"},{"pair":"vertical-1","A":"up","B":"down","reason":"A 面部较抬起、眼睛可见，B 帽檐压低且明显低头。"},{"pair":"vertical-2","A":"up","B":"down","reason":"A 下巴与视线抬高，B 头部下俯、视线下压。"},{"pair":"vertical-3","A":"down","B":"up","reason":"A 帽檐压住眼线并低头，B 面部与鼻尖上扬。"},{"pair":"vertical-4","A":"up","B":"down","reason":"A 鼻尖和下巴上抬，B 眼线较低且面部下俯。"},{"pair":"vertical-5","A":"up","B":"down","reason":"A 仰脸、鼻尖上扬，B 帽檐遮眼并明显低头。"},{"pair":"vertical-6","A":"up","B":"down","reason":"A 眼线与面部轮廓朝上，B 头部和视线朝下。"},{"pair":"vertical-7","A":"up","B":"down","reason":"A 面部抬起且眼睛可见，B 帽檐压低、下巴内收。"}]}
